  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Textile Initiative: Together for Change (STITCH) {PoV MoFA-ML}</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As the Sustainable Textile Initiative: Together for Change (STITCH) consortium, we envision a global garment industry that contributes to an equal and just society by respecting human rights in the world of work. The global garment industry is fragmented and complex, involving many actors across the globe, with varying levels of power and influence.</narrative>
  </description>
